Physical lens profile (optional, PARCHAOS_GLASS_PHYSICAL=1)

The optional lens profile follows the optics derivation in quickLiquid's PHYSICS.md by Amarnath
(https://github.com/amarnath3003/quickLiquid), released under the MIT License: the sideways shift is the
refracted ray's slope times the glass thickness it crosses, and dispersion scales with the local shift
(blue more than red). No code from quickLiquid is used; the idea is credited here.

